#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:101
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<action>Create a new icon.</action> If the current file has been modified "
"you will be asked if you want to save the changes. After that a dialog will "
"open where you can choose to create the icon from scratch or from a template."
