#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:359
#, no-c-format
msgid "Statusbar"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:361
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The status bar keeps you informed of current operations. From left to right, "
"it tells you the x,y coordinates of the pixel you are working on, the size "
"of the current canvas, the zoom factor, and the current number of colors in "
"the icon."
msgstr ""

